WEBVTT

00:22.000 --> 00:26.680
PROSPERITY

00:26.760 --> 00:29.200
The first time I learned about death

00:29.280 --> 00:31.640
was at my dad's funeral.

00:32.880 --> 00:36.160
My dad had nine siblings.

00:37.000 --> 00:38.840
They had over 40 children in total.

00:39.480 --> 00:40.400
So on that day,

00:40.480 --> 00:43.760
I met countless relatives.

00:46.840 --> 00:48.680
After paying respect to my dad,

00:48.760 --> 00:50.640
I turned around and saw face after face

00:50.720 --> 00:52.760
that seemed to be made from the same mold.

00:53.720 --> 00:54.920
I almost burst out laughing.

00:56.720 --> 00:58.040
But I managed to hold it in.

00:59.920 --> 01:03.280
Young as I was, I still knew

01:03.360 --> 01:05.560
that it was inappropriate to laugh

01:05.640 --> 01:06.920
when others were crying.

01:11.960 --> 01:15.440
Ever since then,
every time I walk down the street,

01:15.960 --> 01:17.680
I always size up strangers,

01:18.400 --> 01:23.320
guessing where the people
who look like them have gone.

01:25.360 --> 01:28.640
People desperately reproduce offspring,

01:28.720 --> 01:31.600
then they are separated,

01:31.680 --> 01:35.920
and eventually, they reunite at funerals

01:36.000 --> 01:37.840
because of their blood ties.

01:41.240 --> 01:42.720
How miraculous is that?

01:44.160 --> 01:46.000
Even if they marry outsiders

01:46.960 --> 01:48.600
and mix different blood,

01:49.400 --> 01:53.880
they can't get rid of
the original appearance of a family.

02:16.000 --> 02:18.200
Are you the emergency contact
for the patient?

02:18.280 --> 02:19.440
Yes, I am.

02:20.320 --> 02:21.440
How is her condition?

02:21.520 --> 02:23.480
She was just transferred out of the ICU.

02:23.560 --> 02:24.840
She is relatively stable.

02:24.920 --> 02:26.240
We'll do a few more checks later

02:26.320 --> 02:28.520
and observe for 24 hours
before we discuss further.

02:28.600 --> 02:29.760
Thank you.

02:29.840 --> 02:31.440
It's nothing. Go in and take a look.

04:20.640 --> 04:25.520
ADAPTED FROM THE ORIGINAL WORK
"LOVER" BY SHE MU SI

04:30.240 --> 04:31.080
Mom.

04:31.160 --> 04:32.200
Mom, please wake up.

04:32.280 --> 04:34.000
Mom, wake up.

04:34.080 --> 04:35.800
Mom.

04:35.880 --> 04:37.280
Family members are not allowed in.

04:37.360 --> 04:38.480
Please stay outside.

04:38.560 --> 04:39.880
Please save my mom.

04:39.960 --> 04:41.080
Mom, stay strong!

04:41.160 --> 04:42.640
I'll be waiting outside for you!

05:04.680 --> 05:06.720
Doctor, please tell me.

05:06.800 --> 05:08.600
Why did my mom
suddenly become like this today?

05:08.680 --> 05:10.400
Doesn't she just have
a common heart disease?

05:10.480 --> 05:12.440
The patient is already inside.
Please calm down.

05:12.520 --> 05:13.920
Our most professional doctors

05:14.000 --> 05:15.800
are in the operating room, okay?

05:16.760 --> 05:17.640
Professional?

05:18.760 --> 05:19.640
Do you know?

05:19.720 --> 05:22.560
Half a year ago, my dad couldn't
make it out of this operating room.

05:22.640 --> 05:23.640
Will you please calm down?

05:23.720 --> 05:25.240
-We--
-Are you looking down at me?

05:25.320 --> 05:27.640
-Calm down.
-Are you looking down at me? Tell me!

05:27.720 --> 05:30.760
I tell you,
none of you should think of bullying me!

05:31.360 --> 05:32.640
-Hedgehog.
-Let go of me!

05:32.720 --> 05:34.240
-Calm down!
-Listen up.

05:34.320 --> 05:35.960
If anything happens to my mom today,

05:36.040 --> 05:38.240
I will never let you off the hook!

05:38.320 --> 05:40.760
Got it? Did you hear me?

05:40.840 --> 05:42.040
I'm talking to you!

05:45.480 --> 05:46.760
Dr. Fang, are you all right?

05:48.920 --> 05:50.000
Let me help you up.

05:57.640 --> 05:58.480
Hedgehog.

05:59.880 --> 06:00.840
Keep a level head.

06:09.720 --> 06:10.600
Chen Maidong.

06:11.280 --> 06:12.400
My…

06:12.480 --> 06:13.480
My dad has passed away.

06:15.080 --> 06:16.600
I can't afford to lose my mom.

06:18.120 --> 06:19.240
I beg you.

06:20.120 --> 06:21.920
Help me beg them to save my mom.

06:24.240 --> 06:25.080
I'm begging you.

06:27.160 --> 06:28.040
I'm begging you.

06:29.920 --> 06:30.800
I'm begging you.

06:36.600 --> 06:37.560
Mom.

06:38.160 --> 06:40.640
We've been eating dumplings
too often at home.

06:40.720 --> 06:42.240
You make it once and freeze a ton.

06:42.320 --> 06:43.880
We eat it all year.

06:43.960 --> 06:46.960
Eating whatever is provided
is a basic courtesy for children.

06:52.920 --> 06:54.960
Yan sure is courteous.

06:55.040 --> 06:56.640
He doesn't have to do any work.

06:57.520 --> 06:58.880
Don't sow discord again.

06:58.960 --> 07:00.440
Yan and I take turns

07:00.520 --> 07:01.680
keeping Mrs. Chen company.

07:01.760 --> 07:03.920
Finally, he has some time
to do his own thing.

07:04.000 --> 07:06.000
He relies on art to relieve stress.

07:07.640 --> 07:08.680
How is Maidong?

07:09.520 --> 07:11.400
He told me that Ms. Lin is stable now.

07:11.480 --> 07:13.680
But Chen Maidong
must be having a tough time.

07:13.760 --> 07:15.720
He's living in constant fear every day.

07:16.600 --> 07:18.040
He is just too kind.

07:18.560 --> 07:20.120
This won't be easy for him.

07:20.200 --> 07:22.440
Maidong is someone
who faces death every day.

07:23.560 --> 07:25.200
Shouldn't he be mentally stronger than us?

07:27.920 --> 07:29.000
That's all nonsense.

07:29.680 --> 07:31.440
He was sending off other people.

07:31.520 --> 07:33.680
Now it's someone close
who was like a grandma to him.

07:33.760 --> 07:34.760
It's not comparable.

07:35.360 --> 07:37.760
But he won't let me help with anything.

07:37.840 --> 07:39.560
All I can do now is try my best

07:39.640 --> 07:41.040
to keep Mrs. Chen happy.

07:41.560 --> 07:43.360
Luckily, she doesn't know anything.

07:43.920 --> 07:45.560
Honestly, you guys.

07:45.640 --> 07:47.360
I don't know if you're smart or foolish.

07:47.440 --> 07:49.200
They've been best friends
most of their lives.

07:49.280 --> 07:50.880
Suddenly, the video calls have stopped.

07:50.960 --> 07:52.600
Would Mrs. Chen not suspect anything?

07:53.640 --> 07:56.920
But I think Mrs. Chen is doing all right.

07:57.000 --> 07:58.080
She seems quite happy.

07:59.040 --> 08:00.320
That's when you're around.

08:01.480 --> 08:03.960
Perhaps you guys think
you're protecting her.

08:05.080 --> 08:07.080
But she is actually protecting you.

08:15.120 --> 08:16.200
Do you know?

08:16.960 --> 08:18.560
After my dad passed away,

08:20.280 --> 08:22.200
my mom was never able to recover.

08:23.560 --> 08:25.360
I finally decided to be a filial son

08:26.680 --> 08:28.000
and arranged for my mom

08:28.920 --> 08:29.960
to go on a trip.

08:31.200 --> 08:32.480
She was so happy.

08:33.799 --> 08:36.280
She couldn't wait for it.

08:36.360 --> 08:37.760
She eagerly prepared for it

08:37.840 --> 08:39.760
and even told everyone about it.

08:41.120 --> 08:43.360
She said that thanks to me,

08:44.360 --> 08:45.720
she could be extravagant for once.

08:46.440 --> 08:47.840
But just before boarding the flight,

08:49.480 --> 08:50.960
she suddenly had a heart attack.

08:52.280 --> 08:53.520
But as her son,

08:54.840 --> 08:56.600
I never knew she had this illness.

08:59.240 --> 09:01.160
My mom was in the hospital for so long.

09:04.120 --> 09:06.000
She never let anyone worry about her.

09:07.440 --> 09:08.720
She has always been so tough.

09:09.320 --> 09:10.840
The attending doctor said

09:12.040 --> 09:13.960
her health indicators were getting better.

09:14.760 --> 09:15.640
But today…

09:18.120 --> 09:20.480
Today, all of a sudden…

09:21.680 --> 09:23.200
She suddenly collapsed.

09:26.040 --> 09:27.680
They haven't given up on treating her yet.

09:30.080 --> 09:31.080
How can you give up first?

09:31.960 --> 09:32.880
Maidong,

09:36.040 --> 09:37.120
I'm scared.

09:38.000 --> 09:39.000
Do you know

09:40.520 --> 09:42.600
how much I wish
I could take my mom's place in there?

09:43.800 --> 09:44.840
Since I was a child,

09:45.960 --> 09:49.520
I've never let them
not worry about me even a day.

09:49.600 --> 09:52.640
They gave me such a strong body,
but I'm so useless.

09:52.720 --> 09:54.760
Am I not the one who deserves to die?

09:56.120 --> 09:57.280
Shouldn't it be me?

10:06.880 --> 10:07.880
Hedgehog,

10:07.960 --> 10:10.400
since they gave you such a resilient body,

10:11.480 --> 10:13.480
you shouldn't disappoint them.

10:17.560 --> 10:18.880
Once you get through this,

10:21.160 --> 10:22.600
no matter what you do,

10:23.760 --> 10:25.040
or if you want to fight,

10:27.160 --> 10:28.320
I'll be right there with you.

10:50.520 --> 10:51.400
Grandma Shen,

10:52.160 --> 10:54.120
my mom asked me
to bring this box of water to you.

10:54.720 --> 10:55.720
I'll leave it here.

10:56.360 --> 10:58.760
If you need any help in the future,

10:58.840 --> 10:59.760
just call me anytime.

11:00.320 --> 11:01.480
Thank you.

11:03.600 --> 11:04.720
Mrs. Chen.

11:05.680 --> 11:07.680
Why are you here? You're so far from home.

11:09.760 --> 11:11.280
Leave the water. You can go now.

11:11.360 --> 11:13.520
Zhuang Jie just called me looking for you.

11:13.600 --> 11:15.640
-Why are you hiding here?
-Get going.

11:18.440 --> 11:21.760
Wait, I thought you looked down
on the gang of old ladies in Jin Village?

11:21.840 --> 11:23.400
Nonsense. Get going.

11:33.080 --> 11:34.560
GREAT MAN

11:42.000 --> 11:43.280
Chen Maidong,

11:43.360 --> 11:45.120
you haven't talked to me for days.

11:45.200 --> 11:46.640
Are you very busy?

11:46.720 --> 11:48.200
We've all been worried about you.

11:48.280 --> 11:50.040
Are you all right? Are you eating well?

11:50.120 --> 11:51.200
Do you have time to sleep?

11:51.280 --> 11:52.600
You don't even let me speak.

11:53.360 --> 11:54.240
I'm fine.

11:54.840 --> 11:55.760
Are you all okay?

11:55.840 --> 11:56.720
We're all good.

11:56.800 --> 11:58.200
Zhuang Yan and I take turns

11:58.280 --> 11:59.520
visiting your grandma every day.

11:59.600 --> 12:00.840
That must be tiring for you two.

12:00.920 --> 12:01.960
Enough boring talk.

12:02.040 --> 12:04.040
Let's talk about something interesting.

12:07.320 --> 12:08.480
I miss you.

12:13.280 --> 12:14.400
I miss you too.

12:16.040 --> 12:17.200
Take care of yourself.

12:25.880 --> 12:29.040
Any progress with Ms. Lin?

12:32.800 --> 12:34.000
Should we

12:35.440 --> 12:37.720
prepare ourselves?

12:39.840 --> 12:41.120
What should we prepare?

12:42.040 --> 12:44.960
What kind of preparation is right?

12:46.240 --> 12:47.280
Chen Maidong,

12:48.120 --> 12:50.360
it's already a miracle

12:50.440 --> 12:52.080
that Ms. Lin has lasted until today.

12:54.040 --> 12:55.200
For elderly surgical patients,

12:55.280 --> 12:57.200
when it comes to resuscitation,

12:57.920 --> 12:59.760
they are subjected to a tracheotomy,

13:00.240 --> 13:01.480
punctures,

13:01.560 --> 13:04.480
pressors, an invasive ventilator,

13:04.560 --> 13:06.520
and external chest compressions.

13:07.440 --> 13:08.920
Each step is very painful.

13:11.000 --> 13:11.960
I understand.

13:13.800 --> 13:15.640
Do you really not need me
to accompany you?

13:16.360 --> 13:19.080
No need. Take care of my grandma.

13:24.920 --> 13:26.400
They're looking for me. I need to go.

13:36.600 --> 13:37.480
PAN

13:38.760 --> 13:39.760
Hello.

13:42.000 --> 13:42.880
Are you sure?

13:44.520 --> 13:45.480
Did she go again?

13:46.040 --> 13:48.560
Okay, I'm heading there now.
Send me the location.

13:49.040 --> 13:50.080
Ten minutes.

13:54.960 --> 13:55.880
Ms. Lin.

14:09.840 --> 14:10.880
How is it?

14:12.440 --> 14:13.960
If you think you're lacking,

14:14.040 --> 14:15.560
who else is competent?

14:16.200 --> 14:18.080
This is different from my usual job.

14:18.760 --> 14:19.760
I have little confidence.

14:21.560 --> 14:24.920
I'm just grateful I get to enjoy
your service while I'm alive.

14:25.680 --> 14:27.440
It's my honor.

14:28.640 --> 14:29.640
Please don't say that.

14:31.160 --> 14:32.720
As long as you get better soon,

14:33.440 --> 14:34.640
I'll do anything for you.

14:36.200 --> 14:37.280
Maidong,

14:40.080 --> 14:42.040
I'm sorry to trouble you.

14:43.160 --> 14:44.040
Ms. Lin,

14:44.840 --> 14:47.120
don't say that ever again.

14:48.080 --> 14:49.800
I never expected

14:51.080 --> 14:53.000
to have a family member

14:53.080 --> 14:55.160
by my side at this point.

14:56.000 --> 14:58.080
Didn't you ask me
to keep it from everyone?

14:59.280 --> 15:00.640
As long as you say the word,

15:01.240 --> 15:03.320
the whole town is your family, right?

15:03.400 --> 15:04.320
You're right.

15:05.360 --> 15:06.840
I'm very fortunate.

15:06.920 --> 15:08.040
Maidong,

15:09.560 --> 15:10.960
I have no regrets

15:12.760 --> 15:14.080
in my life.

15:15.480 --> 15:17.680
But it doesn't stop me

15:17.760 --> 15:19.840
from envying you and Jie.

15:23.520 --> 15:24.720
You two

15:26.040 --> 15:28.720
must get along well.

15:30.200 --> 15:32.600
Then your grandma will have no regrets

15:34.440 --> 15:37.520
for the rest of her days.

15:39.880 --> 15:40.760
Ms. Lin,

15:42.760 --> 15:43.800
I understand.

15:45.560 --> 15:47.040
I'm going to tidy up the things.

15:47.760 --> 15:50.120
I'll come back later to listen to you.

15:52.720 --> 15:53.640
Here you go.

16:32.080 --> 16:33.960
You seem to be quite comfortable.

16:34.040 --> 16:35.360
You've been so mysterious

16:36.320 --> 16:37.880
that I couldn't find you anywhere.

16:37.960 --> 16:39.440
How did you find your way here?

16:40.760 --> 16:43.280
I had to come and see what you were up to

16:43.360 --> 16:44.680
so I can report to your grandson.

16:44.760 --> 16:45.920
Don't tell Maidong.

16:46.000 --> 16:47.080
Then tell me.

16:49.880 --> 16:50.960
Jie,

16:51.760 --> 16:52.760
look.

16:54.040 --> 16:55.720
Does this look like Ms. Lin's house?

17:01.400 --> 17:02.640
It does,

17:03.720 --> 17:04.680
but it's not.

17:06.119 --> 17:08.240
Everything about Ms. Lin is irreplaceable.

17:08.319 --> 17:09.400
You're right.

17:10.119 --> 17:12.160
But the one and only Lin

17:12.760 --> 17:14.760
will eventually leave me behind

17:14.839 --> 17:16.160
and go first.

17:17.400 --> 17:19.920
Grandma, don't think about that.

17:22.319 --> 17:23.160
Jie,

17:25.079 --> 17:26.319
as people age,

17:26.400 --> 17:30.560
they naturally become somewhat prophetic.

17:31.520 --> 17:33.200
Lately, I've been making observations here

17:34.160 --> 17:35.360
with others around my age.

17:36.360 --> 17:37.840
Take the seniors in Jin Village.

17:38.920 --> 17:40.000
Once they pass 70,

17:41.040 --> 17:42.880
their most important task each day

17:44.960 --> 17:46.240
isn't no longer living life

17:47.360 --> 17:49.040
but waiting to depart from life.

17:51.640 --> 17:53.280
They keep the gods in mind,

17:53.880 --> 17:56.280
believing that
only under the watch of the gods

17:56.840 --> 17:58.520
can their souls ascend.

18:00.160 --> 18:02.600
They're afraid of dying
either outside their own homes

18:03.160 --> 18:04.960
or inside their own rooms.

18:06.120 --> 18:07.480
Therefore, they decided

18:08.120 --> 18:10.000
to move their beds to the living room,

18:10.920 --> 18:12.640
waiting for their final moment.

18:17.200 --> 18:19.840
It's like completing the ultimate test.

18:21.480 --> 18:23.120
I don't like this tradition.

18:24.200 --> 18:25.920
As long as we still live in this world,

18:27.040 --> 18:28.320
we should live it well.

18:30.680 --> 18:32.160
At our age,

18:34.120 --> 18:36.960
we have no energy
to fight against the maker anymore.

18:39.000 --> 18:40.240
Once someone dies,

18:40.320 --> 18:41.960
they won't come back.

18:43.120 --> 18:46.320
No one knows what it is like over there.

18:48.160 --> 18:49.560
The closer we get to that point,

18:51.200 --> 18:52.280
the more scared we become.

18:55.880 --> 18:57.680
Heart rate. Blood pressure.

18:57.760 --> 18:58.960
Heart rate monitor.

18:59.040 --> 18:59.920
Here it is.

19:01.440 --> 19:03.320
Dr. Fang, this is the latest data.

19:03.400 --> 19:04.560
All right, let me check.

19:07.880 --> 19:09.800
How long has the patient been unconscious?

19:14.160 --> 19:16.720
The patient is a three on the coma scale.

19:16.800 --> 19:17.680
Pulse is 40.

19:19.240 --> 19:20.320
Pupils are dilated.

19:21.600 --> 19:23.280
When these indicators appear,

19:23.360 --> 19:25.440
we can announce it to the family.

19:26.400 --> 19:27.360
Announce what?

19:38.960 --> 19:40.240
Hello.

19:40.320 --> 19:41.320
Yes, I am.

19:46.280 --> 19:47.200
Announce what?

19:47.280 --> 19:48.320
Brain death.

19:49.040 --> 19:51.200
But the machine
still shows breathing and a heartbeat.

19:51.280 --> 19:53.960
The life support system
doesn't represent life itself.

19:54.040 --> 19:55.520
Once the machine stops…

19:56.760 --> 19:58.280
The vital signs will cease.

20:02.680 --> 20:03.600
I understand.

20:05.200 --> 20:06.080
Thank you.

20:31.880 --> 20:32.960
Mrs. Chen.

20:33.040 --> 20:34.240
Jie.

20:37.240 --> 20:39.080
What does brain death mean?

20:43.680 --> 20:45.080
Ms. Lin said

20:45.680 --> 20:49.200
that I could only open this letter

20:50.760 --> 20:52.480
after the hospital gave the final notice.

20:52.560 --> 20:54.400
FOR GU BEIBEI ONLY

20:54.480 --> 20:56.360
Do you think brain death means

20:57.480 --> 20:58.680
it's the end?

20:59.480 --> 21:01.560
Though the brain is dead,
isn't the person still alive?

21:02.840 --> 21:04.000
Let's try to save Lin again.

21:04.760 --> 21:06.640
Let's save her again, okay?

21:10.680 --> 21:11.960
Ms. Lin said

21:13.120 --> 21:14.520
that if she has no chance to live,

21:15.360 --> 21:16.680
then don't resuscitate her.

21:20.680 --> 21:22.400
But I still can't make the decision.

21:24.080 --> 21:25.960
Can you give me some professional advice?

21:26.520 --> 21:28.280
When treatment no longer works,

21:28.360 --> 21:30.360
professional advice becomes meaningless.

21:35.400 --> 21:36.520
Mrs. Chen,

21:37.640 --> 21:39.640
every brain surgeon

21:39.720 --> 21:42.240
struggles daily to save the patient's life

21:42.320 --> 21:44.080
while also enduring personal distress.

21:45.760 --> 21:46.640
For example,

21:47.560 --> 21:49.720
should they risk losing vision

21:50.920 --> 21:52.840
to remove a brain hemorrhage?

21:52.920 --> 21:55.640
Should they sacrifice
the patient's use of their right hand

21:55.720 --> 21:58.000
to stop the patient's continuous seizures?

21:59.840 --> 22:00.840
Or…

22:02.080 --> 22:03.200
even though they know

22:03.840 --> 22:05.760
that the patient lying in the bed

22:07.680 --> 22:10.080
can never go back
to the way they were before

22:11.400 --> 22:14.280
and may even lose their basic dignity,

22:15.520 --> 22:16.720
should they try to save them?

22:20.000 --> 22:21.040
You should know

22:22.320 --> 22:24.160
there is never a best choice.

22:46.360 --> 22:47.520
What Ms. Lin most desires

22:53.520 --> 22:55.040
is dignity.

22:56.120 --> 22:57.280
So Mrs. Chen,

23:00.480 --> 23:02.960
Ms. Lin led her whole life with dignity.

23:08.080 --> 23:11.280
Let's leave her this last dignity.

23:30.080 --> 23:31.520
Lin.

23:33.960 --> 23:35.640
Lin.

23:43.360 --> 23:44.960
Lin.

24:16.640 --> 24:18.120
You never listen to my advice.

24:18.200 --> 24:19.760
You're old now.

24:19.840 --> 24:22.040
Taking good care of yourself
is well enough.

24:22.120 --> 24:25.760
You shouldn't take in
all those cats, dogs, and rabbits anymore.

24:26.640 --> 24:30.040
This old cat doesn't have many days left.

24:30.760 --> 24:33.400
Qi has kept it for over ten years

24:33.480 --> 24:35.080
and treated it like his family.

24:35.160 --> 24:36.280
How can he bear

24:36.360 --> 24:38.480
to watch it take its last breath?

24:39.400 --> 24:42.000
Or watch it lose its fur?

24:42.080 --> 24:43.640
Its tail has become thin.

24:45.160 --> 24:46.320
That's sad.

24:47.280 --> 24:49.080
There must be someone

24:49.160 --> 24:50.600
to accompany it for a peaceful death.

24:51.480 --> 24:54.040
That's why I don't like
keeping these living creatures.

24:54.560 --> 24:57.120
When they're healthy, they ignore you.

24:57.680 --> 25:00.520
But when they're about to die,
they suffer for days.

25:03.720 --> 25:07.080
Humans are like animals.

25:08.280 --> 25:10.080
The day to leave will eventually arrive.

25:11.120 --> 25:12.760
When the time comes,

25:12.840 --> 25:16.000
think about the lovely days

25:16.080 --> 25:17.920
that we've spent together.

25:20.440 --> 25:22.440
Then we won't be immersed in sadness.

25:29.600 --> 25:33.440
-I have acknowledged for a long time
-Lin!

25:33.520 --> 25:35.520
that the day I leave

25:35.600 --> 25:38.040
won't be filled with joy

25:38.120 --> 25:39.720
or be crowded with family members.

25:41.120 --> 25:44.080
But because I chose this path myself,

25:44.920 --> 25:47.040
I've never regretted it.

25:48.360 --> 25:49.760
I have no attachments

25:49.840 --> 25:51.920
in this world,

25:52.920 --> 25:56.640
except for worrying about you.

25:58.280 --> 26:02.080
That's why I wrote this letter
to you in advance.

26:03.320 --> 26:06.600
You have to promise me to only open it

26:06.680 --> 26:10.800
when the hospital
gives you the final notice.

26:12.200 --> 26:14.480
-The deceased gets priority.
-Happy birthday.

26:14.560 --> 26:16.960
-You have to listen to me.
-Happy birthday.

26:17.760 --> 26:19.080
Are you serious?

26:19.160 --> 26:20.720
Is this really my lucky color?

26:21.240 --> 26:23.360
Remember to wear it every day.

26:23.440 --> 26:26.160
You might just get lucky.

26:26.240 --> 26:28.560
Every individual's story

26:28.640 --> 26:31.160
has many different possible endings.

26:32.360 --> 26:35.080
No matter which one it is, it's fine.

26:36.520 --> 26:37.960
If you were to ask those

26:38.040 --> 26:39.960
who have already passed away

26:40.040 --> 26:42.480
if they're satisfied with their death,

26:43.640 --> 26:46.760
I guess most would want

26:46.840 --> 26:48.560
to change their ending.

26:50.360 --> 26:51.960
But for me, I think

26:52.040 --> 26:54.000
no matter how I die,

26:54.680 --> 26:57.360
dead is dead.

26:58.040 --> 27:00.080
There's nothing to struggle with.

27:02.360 --> 27:03.760
For most of my life,

27:04.320 --> 27:06.080
I've been able

27:06.880 --> 27:09.160
to make my own decisions,

27:09.760 --> 27:11.880
even in death.

27:13.320 --> 27:17.320
So I'm quite satisfied with my own ending.

27:18.120 --> 27:22.560
And please don't feel sorry for me.

27:33.840 --> 27:35.400
In the first week after I'm gone,

27:35.880 --> 27:38.960
you might receive a few greeting calls

27:40.080 --> 27:42.040
and visits of condolences.

27:42.840 --> 27:44.200
Don't get annoyed.

27:44.680 --> 27:47.360
Allow others to care for you

27:47.440 --> 27:48.280
and talk about me.

27:48.360 --> 27:50.000
If it rains, hold an umbrella.

27:50.080 --> 27:52.320
Put out the quilt to dry
when the sun comes out.

27:52.400 --> 27:54.120
Accept what may come.

27:54.200 --> 27:56.240
And be happy doing it.

27:57.000 --> 27:58.760
Time passes really quickly, doesn't it?

27:59.320 --> 28:02.960
When we were young,
we held each other's tiny hands.

28:03.040 --> 28:04.280
And now?

28:04.360 --> 28:07.360
-We're holding each other's wrinkly hands.
-Wrinkly hands.

28:28.160 --> 28:30.480
What's wrong with you?
Did something happen?

28:32.920 --> 28:34.000
Ms. Lin

28:36.280 --> 28:37.160
has passed away.

28:43.920 --> 28:45.520
Watch the house. Wait for your brother.

28:46.920 --> 28:48.520
Don't cry. Follow me.

28:56.880 --> 28:59.400
At some point,
the pain of losing a loved one

28:59.480 --> 29:03.120
always makes people
feel extremely hopeless

29:04.040 --> 29:08.200
and think that only endless loneliness
and sorrow await

29:08.280 --> 29:09.520
in the future.

29:11.400 --> 29:12.760
But that's not true.

29:13.280 --> 29:16.280
Time heals all wounds.

29:24.520 --> 29:27.120
Lin, I'm here!

29:27.920 --> 29:29.200
There you are.

29:29.280 --> 29:31.600
You're just in time
to try what I just learned to make.

29:31.680 --> 29:33.080
Coffee jelly.

29:33.160 --> 29:34.440
Why did you hang this photo here?

29:34.520 --> 29:35.600
I don't get it.

29:36.120 --> 29:38.680
Why must a man dress like this?

29:38.760 --> 29:41.720
You should steer clear
of what you shouldn't see.

29:41.800 --> 29:43.520
Then you'll have ease of mind.

29:44.920 --> 29:46.280
How come you're giving me this now?

29:46.360 --> 29:48.120
You always nagged about it.

29:48.200 --> 29:50.240
Whatever you like is yours now.

29:50.880 --> 29:52.680
I love it when you clean your house.

29:52.760 --> 29:54.760
I'm sure to find many treasures.

29:57.520 --> 29:59.120
In the second week after I'm gone,

29:59.600 --> 30:01.960
you should go outside

30:02.040 --> 30:04.720
and talk more to the people around you.

30:05.520 --> 30:09.160
Chat about topics
that aren't related to death.

30:09.240 --> 30:11.360
Don't suffer alone.

30:16.840 --> 30:17.840
Mrs. Chen.

31:35.280 --> 31:37.200
Sir, I walk through here every day.

31:37.280 --> 31:38.400
You can't block my way.

31:38.480 --> 31:40.200
You can't go through here. Go back.

31:40.280 --> 31:42.400
Going around will take me
an extra two hours!

31:42.480 --> 31:43.520
-What--
-The road is closed.

31:43.600 --> 31:44.760
No. You…

31:44.840 --> 31:46.360
-I can't help you.
-How can you…

31:47.440 --> 31:48.640
Jisan Goose!

31:49.240 --> 31:50.200
Jisan Goose, come back!

31:50.280 --> 31:52.520
-You don't belong to a farm!
-What are you doing? No entry!

31:52.600 --> 31:54.760
Sir, my goose!
You scared my goose to the other side.

31:54.840 --> 31:57.280
Which goose is yours?
Aren't they all the same?

31:57.360 --> 31:58.840
The unique one there.

31:58.920 --> 32:00.760
I don't see the difference.

32:01.640 --> 32:02.520
It's just a goose.

32:02.600 --> 32:04.040
Buy another one at the goose farm.

32:04.120 --> 32:05.040
You don't get it!

32:05.640 --> 32:07.440
Jisan Goose is not an ordinary poultry.

32:07.520 --> 32:09.440
It's the most extraordinary goose
in the world.

32:09.520 --> 32:11.120
What's so special about it?

32:11.200 --> 32:13.840
Roosters, wild dogs, and white geese

32:13.920 --> 32:15.480
are just bullies in the village.

32:15.560 --> 32:17.800
If you don't eat them, they'll bite you.

32:17.880 --> 32:18.880
They're useless.

32:19.440 --> 32:21.040
Give me back my goose!

32:21.120 --> 32:23.640
Jisan Goose, come back now!

32:23.720 --> 32:25.200
Come back quickly!

32:28.040 --> 32:30.760
You have to accept
that life and death are destined.

32:30.840 --> 32:32.400
Nothing in this world is permanent.

32:33.600 --> 32:35.880
If you can't catch up, just let it go.

32:36.560 --> 32:37.920
Don't cry.

32:52.040 --> 32:54.560
If you're upset,

32:54.640 --> 32:57.160
try taking deep breaths.

33:03.680 --> 33:05.120
Qin Xuezhi's family?

33:07.680 --> 33:08.840
Just letting you know,

33:08.920 --> 33:11.200
the surgery is halfway through
and going quite smoothly.

33:11.280 --> 33:12.120
Doctor,

33:12.680 --> 33:14.800
thank you for your hard work.

33:14.880 --> 33:15.840
Not at all.

33:17.200 --> 33:19.680
Our current surgical plan is challenging
in terms of technique,

33:19.760 --> 33:23.080
but if successful,
it will reduce postoperative bleeding

33:23.160 --> 33:25.280
and improve the closure rate
of the distal false lumen.

33:25.360 --> 33:27.440
Your mom is only 64. She's still young.

33:27.520 --> 33:28.880
We'll do our best.

33:29.360 --> 33:30.200
Thank you.

33:30.720 --> 33:33.480
I have always felt that we women

33:33.560 --> 33:37.200
are the strongest creatures in this world.

33:37.840 --> 33:39.880
Every family in this world

33:39.960 --> 33:41.560
is able to survive

33:41.640 --> 33:43.840
mainly thanks to the resilience of women.

33:45.200 --> 33:47.040
Women are the foundation

33:47.120 --> 33:48.920
upon which everything is built.

33:49.600 --> 33:51.200
So my dear sister,

33:52.000 --> 33:54.200
I believe

33:54.280 --> 33:56.240
you can definitely
get through the days without me.

33:57.680 --> 34:03.120
I hope you can sincerely tell me,

34:03.640 --> 34:08.440
"Lin, you've done a great job
in your life."

34:11.040 --> 34:14.040
Both you and I are mature old ladies

34:14.120 --> 34:16.280
who have gone through a lot in life.

34:17.639 --> 34:19.000
We should understand

34:19.560 --> 34:22.159
that getting hurt
and going through hardships

34:22.239 --> 34:25.760
are part of life.

34:27.199 --> 34:31.360
You're not the only one
who feels sadness and pain,

34:31.840 --> 34:34.920
nor are you the most unfortunate person
in the world.

34:37.199 --> 34:38.800
When it comes to the topic of suffering,

34:38.880 --> 34:42.520
many people can easily surpass you.

34:43.199 --> 34:46.080
So in other words,

34:46.159 --> 34:52.000
no one is enduring pain alone.

34:57.560 --> 34:59.760
You should treat yourself nicer.

35:00.840 --> 35:02.880
Wear clean clothes

35:02.960 --> 35:05.080
and eat steaming-hot meals.

35:06.680 --> 35:07.760
Other than these,

35:08.680 --> 35:10.840
there's nothing else
I need to remind you of.

35:12.640 --> 35:14.360
We've come a long way,

35:14.440 --> 35:16.120
and it's time for us to bid farewell.

35:17.120 --> 35:20.360
So that's all for now.

35:22.720 --> 35:24.360
My dear Chen,

35:25.240 --> 35:28.960
let's meet again in heaven.

35:42.640 --> 35:43.520
Mom,

35:45.000 --> 35:46.840
are we not going to look for Jisan Goose?

35:48.880 --> 35:50.160
No.

35:50.240 --> 35:51.600
A forced tie won't make us close.

35:55.120 --> 35:56.200
Mom,

35:57.200 --> 35:59.200
can we really leave Mrs. Chen alone

35:59.280 --> 36:00.760
without our company?

36:00.840 --> 36:02.040
Chen Maidong is not at home.

36:02.120 --> 36:04.080
I don't feel at ease.

36:04.160 --> 36:05.800
At least not right now.

36:06.600 --> 36:08.440
Just let her stay quietly
at Ms. Lin's house.

36:12.920 --> 36:16.640
Mom, I know you're most annoyed
with me for being sentimental.

36:17.640 --> 36:18.480
But

36:19.320 --> 36:21.840
why do people always have
to endure all these?

36:26.000 --> 36:28.400
You guys can only talk
about theories on paper.

36:29.080 --> 36:31.200
When something does happen,
you have no idea what to do.

36:32.160 --> 36:33.000
Zhuang Jie,

36:33.080 --> 36:34.680
don't underestimate Mrs. Chen.

36:35.360 --> 36:37.320
She's from the same generation
as your grandfather.

36:37.400 --> 36:39.480
They've done ten times more
in their lives than you.

36:39.560 --> 36:41.760
They've survived through thick and thin.

36:42.960 --> 36:44.160
From a modern perspective,

36:44.240 --> 36:46.320
your grandpa wasn't a good dad.

36:48.640 --> 36:51.160
Your uncle and I were brought up by him,

36:51.240 --> 36:53.080
taught to be literate and sensible,

36:53.160 --> 36:55.000
and not to delve deeper into academics.

36:55.080 --> 36:56.720
No matter how the world changes,

36:56.800 --> 36:58.760
we believe that survival
is the important thing.

37:00.680 --> 37:02.000
He raised children

37:02.080 --> 37:04.040
by beating them whenever they disobeyed,

37:04.120 --> 37:06.840
with the belief that it would
knock down their rebelliousness

37:06.920 --> 37:08.600
so that they can survive in society.

37:09.520 --> 37:12.520
If that were to happen today,
no one would stand for it.

37:13.280 --> 37:15.080
But at that time, it was so-called wisdom.

37:16.560 --> 37:17.720
When it came to my generation,

37:18.680 --> 37:20.880
we didn't care about anything unrealistic.

37:20.960 --> 37:22.840
Then I got married and had children.

37:22.920 --> 37:24.200
I witnessed the country

37:24.280 --> 37:26.600
getting better and stronger day by day,

37:26.680 --> 37:28.440
and food and clothing
weren't worries anymore.

37:29.560 --> 37:31.720
The most difficult thing
was teaching you guys.

37:33.120 --> 37:35.400
I couldn't use
your grandpa's method on you.

37:35.480 --> 37:38.720
You guys always talk
about freedom and equality.

37:38.800 --> 37:41.160
You pay attention to big matters
from all over the world.

37:41.240 --> 37:43.880
You discuss new things
that I don't understand at all.

37:45.720 --> 37:47.120
That's supposed to be a good thing,

37:47.200 --> 37:48.640
as it means that your lives

37:48.720 --> 37:50.000
are better than mine.

37:50.080 --> 37:52.160
Right? And you have a broader perspective.

37:52.240 --> 37:54.400
But we shouldn't only think
about the distant future

37:54.480 --> 37:56.000
and ignore the present.

37:56.080 --> 37:57.640
Putting other things aside,

37:57.720 --> 37:58.760
let's talk about

37:59.520 --> 38:00.640
when I'm gone someday.

38:02.680 --> 38:05.680
The three of you won't get to eat
this braised chicken anymore,

38:05.760 --> 38:08.480
let alone these dried radishes
and pickled vegetables.

38:14.000 --> 38:18.160
Humans experience
birth, aging, illness, and death.

38:19.120 --> 38:20.600
We need to accept whatever comes.

38:22.760 --> 38:23.880
No matter how much we know,

38:25.520 --> 38:27.440
it can't compare
to experiencing it ourselves.

38:27.520 --> 38:28.840
No one can escape it.

38:53.880 --> 38:55.000
This weather is perfect

38:55.080 --> 38:56.560
for flying kites.

38:57.280 --> 38:58.600
If Mr. He were still here,

38:58.680 --> 39:00.800
he would definitely place first
in the kite competition.

39:00.880 --> 39:02.800
Unfortunately,
there are no "ifs" in this world.

39:04.000 --> 39:06.080
Mr. He and Ms. Lin

39:06.680 --> 39:08.280
can only live in our hearts.

39:13.720 --> 39:15.080
Jie,

39:15.720 --> 39:17.080
Maidong is coming back soon, right?

39:19.320 --> 39:20.280
In these two days.

39:20.800 --> 39:22.560
I heard you

39:23.240 --> 39:25.040
talking to Xixia on the phone last night.

39:26.000 --> 39:27.680
Are you going back to Shanghai?

39:29.120 --> 39:31.520
I've never said
I'm not going back to Shanghai.

39:32.040 --> 39:33.200
What about Maidong?

39:34.040 --> 39:36.320
Why don't you ask about my job?

39:36.400 --> 39:40.080
To me, a career
is far less important than love.

39:40.160 --> 39:42.480
Yan, if you post this opinion online,

39:42.560 --> 39:45.240
you will be called lovesick
or a marriage mule.

39:45.320 --> 39:47.680
I don't care
what those keyboard warriors say.

39:48.200 --> 39:49.880
I only care about you and Maidong.

39:52.240 --> 39:54.160
No one cares about Maidong more than I do.

39:54.720 --> 39:56.560
But I'm not just a salesperson.

39:57.120 --> 39:58.760
Just because I'm disabled,

39:58.840 --> 40:00.200
I understand better than others

40:00.280 --> 40:02.040
how medical technology can change fate.

40:03.520 --> 40:05.240
Didn't you read a foreign article online

40:05.320 --> 40:06.720
a few days ago?

40:07.400 --> 40:09.080
How did they describe ventilators?

40:09.760 --> 40:11.720
Ventilators redefined the end of life.

40:11.800 --> 40:12.640
You're right.

40:13.960 --> 40:16.280
Behind all businesses,
there can be warmth.

40:17.000 --> 40:18.680
What I pursue is not only money

40:19.480 --> 40:21.600
but the hope
that there are "ifs" in this world.

40:21.680 --> 40:24.240
If medical technology is more advanced,

40:24.320 --> 40:26.880
and if domestic instruments
are more common,

40:27.640 --> 40:29.960
other people
who are like Mr. He or Ms. Lin

40:30.960 --> 40:32.680
may have a chance to survive.

40:34.360 --> 40:35.480
Do you understand?

40:39.480 --> 40:40.480
Let's fly the kite.

40:41.520 --> 40:43.920
He Niaoniao, let's fly the kite.

40:44.000 --> 40:45.000
I'm coming.

41:00.600 --> 41:03.360
Jie, let's fly the kite high.

41:03.440 --> 41:05.480
My dad and Ms. Lin will be able to see it.

41:05.560 --> 41:06.480
Am I right?

41:06.560 --> 41:07.600
That's right.

41:12.720 --> 41:14.880
I heard that your mom's surgery went well.

41:14.960 --> 41:15.880
Yes.

41:16.440 --> 41:18.880
I didn't know how to thank the doctors.

41:19.440 --> 41:21.440
They don't expect your gratitude.

41:21.520 --> 41:23.320
Just stop throwing your punches at them.

41:24.560 --> 41:25.880
Don't tease me anymore.

41:26.880 --> 41:29.400
I'll quit fighting from now on.

41:30.920 --> 41:32.680
Then the happiest one will be your mom.

41:33.520 --> 41:36.680
Good times are waiting ahead for her.

41:37.400 --> 41:38.760
You can go back.

41:41.000 --> 41:41.920
Maidong,

41:43.040 --> 41:44.160
are you okay?

41:45.440 --> 41:47.920
You don't seem
to have slept much these days.

41:49.320 --> 41:50.200
How should I put it?

41:51.240 --> 41:52.960
It felt a bit surreal this morning.

41:53.520 --> 41:54.640
I only understand now

41:55.440 --> 41:57.120
the feeling of handling funeral affairs

41:58.160 --> 41:59.360
as a family member.

42:00.200 --> 42:01.520
We're not young anymore.

42:02.200 --> 42:03.240
Some things

42:04.120 --> 42:05.040
are inevitable.

42:05.120 --> 42:07.280
I've been handling others' affairs
all these years

42:08.240 --> 42:09.360
and thought that I was tough.

42:11.040 --> 42:12.560
But when it actually happened to me,

42:14.880 --> 42:16.000
I couldn't take it.

42:16.880 --> 42:18.360
How about your grandma?

42:19.200 --> 42:20.240
Is she holding it together?

42:20.840 --> 42:22.040
To my surprise,

42:22.840 --> 42:24.400
she is stronger than me.

42:24.480 --> 42:25.720
She even comforted me in return.

42:26.840 --> 42:27.720
That's good then.

42:28.480 --> 42:29.560
Please take care.

42:30.640 --> 42:31.600
You too.

42:41.720 --> 42:45.280
STROKE, CHEST PAIN, GREEN PATH

42:45.360 --> 42:46.240
Hey.

42:47.000 --> 42:48.680
I heard that you work at a funeral parlor.

42:51.200 --> 42:52.120
I do.

42:55.200 --> 42:56.480
How can I help you?

43:04.680 --> 43:06.240
Can we talk somewhere else?

43:07.320 --> 43:08.480
I'm willing to pay.

43:12.520 --> 43:13.360
Sure.

45:25.600 --> 45:32.320
ALL ANIMALS IN THIS PROGRAM
WERE TREATED KINDLY
